Third-party components bundled with tidyEmoji
=============================================

tidyEmoji itself is released under GPL (>= 3); see the License field of
DESCRIPTION. Six of the datasets it ships were produced by other authors and
carry their own terms. All six are reproduced here in full, because naming a
licence is not the same as supplying it: CC BY-SA 4.0 asks that a link to the
licence travel with the work, the MIT and Unicode licences ask that their
copyright and permission notices be included in all copies, and the Apache
License 2.0 asks that recipients be given a copy of it.


1. data/emoji_sentiment_lexicon.rda  --  Emoji Sentiment Ranking 1.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:    Kralj Novak P, Smailovic J, Sluban B, Mozetic I (2015).
           "Sentiment of Emojis." PLoS ONE 10(12): e0144296.
           doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0144296
Dataset:   Emoji Sentiment Ranking 1.0, CLARIN.SI repository,
           https://hdl.handle.net/11356/1048
Licence:   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
           (CC BY-SA 4.0)
Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
Summary:   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

On compatibility: Creative Commons declared CC BY-SA 4.0 one-way compatible
with the GNU GPL version 3 on 8 October 2015, with the Free Software
Foundation concurring, so redistributing this dataset inside a GPL (>= 3)
package is permitted. See
https://creativecommons.org/compatible-licenses/ and
https://wiki.creativecommons.org/wiki/ShareAlike_compatibility:_GPLv3

The lexicon is redistributed with its scores unchanged; tidyEmoji adds a
derived `key` column (the code-point key described in ?emoji_key) so the
table can be joined to detected glyphs.


