4. data/oasst_messages.rda and data/oasst_reactions.rda  --  OASST2
-------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:    Kopf A, Kilcher Y, von Rutte D, Anagnostidis S, Tam ZR, Stevens K,
           et al. (2023). "OpenAssistant Conversations: Democratizing Large
           Language Model Alignment." NeurIPS 2023 Datasets and Benchmarks.
           https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.07327
Dataset:   OpenAssistant Conversations, release 2 (OASST2),
           https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenAssistant/oasst2
           file 2023-11-05_oasst2_ready.messages.jsonl.gz at revision
           179dd21fc55192153d94adb0e0ce8f69e222bf75
Copyright: the OpenAssistant contributors
Changes:   a sample of the messages and their reaction tallies, screened and
           drawn by data-raw/oasst.R in the package's source repository; the
           text of each sampled message is unchanged.
Licence:   Apache License 2.0, reproduced below.
           https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

