5. R/sysdata.rda: a snapshot of the emoji package's data
---------------------------------------------------------

Since 0.7.0 tidyEmoji no longer imports the emoji package. It bundles, in
R/sysdata.rda (.emoji_upstream), a copy of the four objects it reads from
emoji 16.0.0 (2024-10-28): the aliases and keywords columns of
emoji::emojis, emoji::emoji_name and emoji::emoji_rx, unchanged.

Source:    emoji 16.0.0, Emil Hvitfeldt, with data parsing code from Hadley
           Wickham and Romain Francois,
           https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=emoji
Rebuilt:   data-raw/crosswalks.R in the package's source repository
Licence:   MIT

