6. R/sysdata.rda and the crosswalk: emojibase data
--------------------------------------------------

Since 0.7.0 the shortcodes of the emoji the emoji package has none for (the
182 of Emoji 17.0 and 18.0, in R/sysdata.rda and in the 202 rows they add to
data/emoji_unicode_crosswalk.rda), the Slack names emoji_from_counts() reads,
and the gender data a test checks emoji_gender() against come from
emojibase-data.

Source:    emojibase-data 18.0.0, Miles Johnson,
           https://github.com/milesj/emojibase
Rebuilt:   data-raw/crosswalks.R in the package's source repository
